Rebased again after #63205 (speculator config classes) removed the `speculative.py` block this fix lived in. The inheritance moved unchanged, with the trimmed comment, to `DraftModelSpeculatorConfig.configure()` in `vllm/v1/worker/gpu/spec_decode/speculator_config.py`, right after the draft `ModelConfig` is built; MTP and DSpark both go through it. `speculative.py` is no longer touched. The two regression tests now use the same patch target and mock fields #63205 gave #42079's test.

On `main` @ `628c455e9` + this commit: 3/3 `mtp_draft` tests pass. With only the fix reverted, #42079's test still passes and both tests from this PR fail, so they exercise the fix.

@njhill the history was rewritten again, so could you take another look and run CI when convenient? Thanks!

